{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415703","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415703","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041570301:1":{"text":"グァッ！？そ、そなた、我とよく似ているな。","source_cn":"咕唔！汝竟与吾如此相像！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E65EF7010D61BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041570302:1":{"text":"異郷人か？どこから来た？そなたの同胞も皆同じ姿をしているのか？","source_cn":"外乡人，汝来自何方？汝之同胞是否都如你这般相貌？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x831B731CEC92A123","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041570303:1":{"text":"似ている？……どこが？","source_cn":"相似？我看不出任何相似点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45824ACC7F85D391","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041570304:1":{"text":"オレの故郷はとっくに滅びた。今はブードゥー神殿に身を置いている。","source_cn":"我的家园早已倾覆。现在，我属于巫毒神庙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4B49E13CCBBFC3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041570305:1":{"text":"一族の者は全員、故郷と自由を守る戦いで命を落とした。彼らは皆、勇敢な戦士たちだった。","source_cn":"至于我的族人，他们都死在了保卫家园与自由的战争里。他们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD2E277AFF66FFBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041570306:1":{"text":"そなたの言葉からは、悲しみが感じられる。どうか、気を落とされぬよう……","source_cn":"……吾能听出汝之伤痛。请节哀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x799755A4A9C2E3A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041570307:1":{"text":"耐えることには、もう慣れている。","source_cn":"我早已学会忍耐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4A3B42C68280657","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041570308:1":{"text":"耐える！？なぜだ？","source_cn":"忍耐！何需如此？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE605211EEEB81F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041570309:1":{"text":"この世に生きていれば、誰しもわだかまりを抱えるもの。感情を発散させるのはごく自然なことだ。","source_cn":"吾等生存于世，难免心中郁结，宣泄压力为人之常情。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x033075706CED2484","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041570310:1":{"text":"そなたも我のように、外を駆け回り、風と一体になってみるといい。","source_cn":"汝可以像吾一般，外出奔跑，感受风与自然。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC302BD97339BBD5F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041570311:1":{"text":"ふっ、それはオレもよくやる。","source_cn":"呵，我的确会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2881B5E298BEE14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041570312:1":{"text":"放たれた矢を追い、夕日を追い、自由を追いかける……それらは皆、心を晴れやかにしてくれる。","source_cn":"追逐飞射的箭矢，追逐落日，追逐自由，都会让人心情愉悦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B8175837CED4B87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041570313:1":{"text":"まさしく然り！思う存分駆けたあとの静けさの中で毛並みを整えるひとときもまた、格別な時間だ。","source_cn":"正是如此！趁着奔跑后的平静时刻梳理毛发，亦是一种别样享受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAB541C1D708CE2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041570314:1":{"text":"……オマエとは、意外と気が合いそうだな。","source_cn":"……看来你我之间，确实有不少共同语言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6D6B43D4D6A428","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041570315:1":{"text":"異郷の戦士よ、約束しよう。務めを果たした暁には、このザルドと速さを競い合おうではないか！","source_cn":"外族的战士，赞东与你立约，待职责卸去，与我来一场速度的较量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84AED4733B348655","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041570316:1":{"text":"オレは走りで負けたことは一度もないぞ。","source_cn":"在奔跑一事上，我还从未尝败绩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70497952E9D3D1A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041570317:1":{"text":"グァッ！望むところだ！","source_cn":"咕唔！吾正有此意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29ADD534F58F47DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卡夫拉":{"text":"カブラ","source":"卡夫拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:赞东":{"text":"ザルド","source":"赞东","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}